{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "clamp_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[B, S, F] (same as reference step)",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min_val",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": -1.0,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "max_val",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1.0,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 torch.clamp(x, min=-1.0, max=1.0)。",
        "对输入张量每个元素限制在 [min_val, max_val] 范围内：y = min(max(x, min_val), max_val)。",
        "min_val 和 max_val 为标量浮点数，默认分别为 -1.0 和 1.0。",
        "输出形状、dtype、device 与输入 x 完全一致。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "layer_norm_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[B, S, F] where F is normalized_shape[0]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "weight",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[F]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "bias",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[F]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "eps",
          "kind": "float",
          "default": 1e-05,
          "optional": true,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 self.layer_norm(x)，模块为 nn.LayerNorm(normalized_shape=(768,), eps=1e-5, elementwise_affine=True, bias=True)。",
        "在 eval 模式下，对输入 x 的最后一维（即 normalized_shape）进行归一化：mean = mean(x, dim=-1, keepdim=True); var = var(x, dim=-1, unbiased=False, keepdim=True); y = (x - mean) / sqrt(var + eps) * weight + bias。",
        "weight 和 bias 形状均为 [F]，与 x 最后一维大小相同；若 elementwise_affine 为 False 则 weight=None, bias=None，但本任务为 True。",
        "输出形状、dtype、device 与输入 x 完全一致。",
        "计算中方差使用有偏估计（即除以 N），与 PyTorch LayerNorm 一致。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = torch.clamp(x, min=-1.0, max=1.0)",
      "semantics": [
        "对输入张量每个元素应用 clamp 操作，限制在 [-1.0, 1.0]。",
        "输出为 new tensor，形状 [512, 512, 768]，dtype float32，device cuda:0。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.layer_norm(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "对 clamp 后的输出应用 LayerNorm，在最后一维 768 上归一化，使用模块的 weight 和 bias，eps=1e-5。",
        "输出形状 [512, 512, 768]，dtype float32，device cuda:0。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回 layer_norm 的输出。",
        "形状 [512, 512, 768]，dtype float32，device cuda:0。"
      ]
    }
  ]
}